{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55392","headline":"酒令 二 · 宋齐丘","name":"酒令 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先吃乳酩，後吃乔团，一似噇脓灌血。\n（齐丘。\n见宋傅肱《蟹谱》卷下。\n）（〖1〗《蟹谱》云：「艺祖时，尝遣使至江表。\n宋齐丘送於郊次，酒行语熟，使者啓令曰：须啗二物，各取南北所尚，复以二物，仍互用南北俚语。\n使者曰〖略〗。\n齐丘继声曰〖略〗。\n时朝廷方草创，用度不给，倚江表爲外府，故齐丘及之。\n左右以令逼使之太甚，相顾失色。\n使者雅叹焉，故归朝而间行。\n」今按：齐入卒於宋立国前一年，此条所记恐有误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋齐丘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}